# Bot #1: 1Day 55/35 band, no trend MA (the profiles.json entry — no band/MA
# overrides). Copy to 1day.env and fill in keys. systemd EnvironmentFile
# syntax: full-line comments only, no inline comments, no quotes needed.
ALPACA_API_KEY=paper_account_key_here
ALPACA_SECRET_KEY=paper_account_secret_here
ALPACA_PAPER=true
TIMEFRAME=1Day
# DBC (broad commodities) added 2026-07-30 to the original 4: the one clean
# diversifying add in the 7y walk-forward (uncorrelated to the US-equity core,
# +34% OOS / 54% win). It held return flat (+138% vs +139%) while cutting max
# DD -19.7% -> -15.3% and raising activity ~22% (8.4 -> 10.2 trades/yr).
# Broader baskets (EEM/VNQ/SLV...) diluted return — evidence in CLAUDE.md.
SYMBOLS=QQQ,GLD,IWM,SPY,DBC
# 20% of current equity per position: with 5 symbols this is fully invested
# when everything signals. Reset the paper account to $2,000 so sizing
# mimics the planned live account ($400 slots that compound with equity).
NOTIONAL_PCT=20
# Separate journal per instance: avoids concurrent-write locking on SQLite
# and keeps each experiment's trades cleanly separated.
TRADES_DB=/opt/rsi-midline-bot/trades-1day.db
# Go-live moment of this instance: the weekly replay check (deploy/
# rsi-replay.timer) re-simulates the live period from here and diffs the
# simulated trades against the journal. Update on every config swap.
# Set to the 2026-07-30 no-MA + DBC swap. Two known one-time artifacts of
# that swap: (1) DBC signalled on 2026-07-13 and 2026-07-29 before it went
# live — both predate this start, so no phantom SIM-ONLY; (2) the SPY
# position opened 2026-07-14 under the old config straddles the swap, so its
# eventual exit will show once as LIVE-ONLY until it closes and the account
# is clean under the new config. Verified green at swap time.
REPLAY_SINCE=2026-07-30T00:00:00Z
